          "path": "models.spice",
          "text": "* Wrapper subcircuits only. They call SKY130 devices (sky130_fd_pr__*) by name;\n* the reader's SKY130 PDK library supplies them.\n.subckt IV_SKY_N_SI D G S B params: W=20u L=1u MULT=1\n.param FINGER_W={min(10u,max(1u,W))}\n.param WRAP_PARALLEL_M={MULT*W/FINGER_W}\nXPDK D G S B sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 W={FINGER_W*1e6} L={L*1e6} m={WRAP_PARALLEL_M}\n.ends IV_SKY_N_SI\n"
